  "passages": [
    {
      "id": "christianisme.p0001",
      "w": "The Gospel According to John",
      "s": "Jesus therefore, being wearied with his journey, sat thus on the well: and it was about the sixth hour.",
      "src": {
        "work": "The Gospel According to John"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "christianisme.p0002",
      "w": "The Gospel According to John",
      "s": "And the man believed the word that Jesus had spoken unto him, and he went his way.",
      "src": {
        "work": "The Gospel According to John"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "christianisme.p0003",
      "w": "The Gospel According to John",
      "s": "If thou do these things, shew thyself to the world.",
      "src": {
        "work": "The Gospel According to John"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "christianisme.p0004",
      "w": "The Gospel According to John",
      "s": "Search, and look: for out of Galilee ariseth no prophet.",
      "src": {
        "work": "The Gospel According to John"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "christianisme.p0005",
      "w": "The Gospel According to John",
      "s": "When he speaketh a lie, he speaketh of his own: for he is a liar, and the father of it.",
      "src": {
        "work": "The Gospel According to John"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "christianisme.p0006",
      "w": "The Gospel According to John",
      "s": "He said unto them, He put clay upon mine eyes, and I washed, and do see.",
      "src": {
        "work": "The Gospel According to John"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "christianisme.p0007",
      "w": "The Gospel According to John",
      "s": "Father, save me from this hour: but for this cause came I unto this hour.",
      "src": {
        "work": "The Gospel According to John"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "christianisme.p0008",
      "w": "The Gospel According to John",
      "s": "Jesus answered him, If I wash thee not, thou hast no part with me.",
      "src": {
        "work": "The Gospel According to John"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "christianisme.p0009",
      "w": "The Gospel According to John",
      "s": "If ye loved me, ye would rejoice, because I said, I go unto the Father: for my Father is greater than I.",
      "src": {
        "work": "The Gospel According to John"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "christianisme.p0010",
      "w": "The Gospel According to John",
      "s": "Verily, verily, I say unto you, Whatsoever ye shall ask the Father in my name, he will give it you.",
      "src": {
        "work": "The Gospel According to John"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "christianisme.p0011",
      "w": "The Gospel According to John",
      "s": "Thine own nation and the chief priests have delivered thee unto me: what hast thou done?",
      "src": {
        "work": "The Gospel According to John"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "christianisme.p0012",
      "w": "The Gospel According to John",
      "s": "And when he had said this, he went out again unto the Jews, and saith unto them, I find in him no fault at all.",
      "src": {
        "work": "The Gospel According to John"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "christianisme.p0013",
      "w": "The Gospel According to John",
      "s": "He came therefore, and took the body of Jesus.",
      "src": {
        "work": "The Gospel According to John"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "christianisme.p0014",
      "w": "The Gospel According to John",
      "s": "Then were the disciples glad, when they saw the LORD.",
      "src": {
        "work": "The Gospel According to John"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "christianisme.p0015",
      "w": "The Gospel According to Luke",
      "s": "And they said, Is not this Joseph's son?",
      "src": {
        "work": "The Gospel According to Luke"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "christianisme.p0016",
      "w": "The Gospel According to Luke",
      "s": "And he rebuking them suffered them not to speak: for they knew that he was Christ.",
      "src": {
        "work": "The Gospel According to Luke"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "christianisme.p0017",
      "w": "The Gospel According to Luke",
      "s": "For with the same measure that ye mete withal it shall be measured to you again.",
      "src": {
        "work": "The Gospel According to Luke"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "christianisme.p0018",
      "w": "The Gospel According to Luke",
      "s": "And he said, Young man, I say unto thee, Arise.",
      "src": {
        "work": "The Gospel According to Luke"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "christianisme.p0019",
      "w": "The Gospel According to Luke",
      "s": "And when he had said these things, he cried, He that hath ears to hear, let him hear.",
      "src": {
        "work": "The Gospel According to Luke"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "christianisme.p0020",
      "w": "The Gospel According to Luke",
      "s": "For oftentimes it had caught him: and he was kept bound with chains and in fetters; and he brake the bands, and was driven of the devil into the wilderness.) 42:008:030 And Jesus asked him, saying, What is thy name?",
      "src": {
        "work": "The Gospel According to Luke"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "christianisme.p0021",
      "w": "The Gospel According to Luke",
      "s": "And Jesus rebuked the unclean spirit, and healed the child, and delivered him again to his father.",
      "src": {
        "work": "The Gospel According to Luke"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "christianisme.p0022",
      "w": "The Gospel According to Luke",
      "s": "Then said Jesus unto him, Go, and do thou likewise.",
      "src": {
        "work": "The Gospel According to Luke"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "christianisme.p0023",
      "w": "The Gospel According to Luke",
      "s": "And he said unto them, 42:013:024 Strive to enter in at the strait gate: for many, I say unto you, will seek to enter in, and shall not be able.",
      "src": {
        "work": "The Gospel According to Luke"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "christianisme.p0024",
      "w": "The Gospel According to Luke",
      "s": "He that hath ears to hear, let him hear.",
      "src": {
        "work": "The Gospel According to Luke"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "christianisme.p0025",
      "w": "The Gospel According to Luke",
      "s": "Nevertheless when the Son of man cometh, shall he find faith on the earth?",
      "src": {
        "work": "The Gospel According to Luke"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "christianisme.p0026",
      "w": "The Gospel According to Luke",
      "s": "I will send my beloved son: it may be they will reverence him when they see him.",
      "src": {
        "work": "The Gospel According to Luke"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "christianisme.p0027",
      "w": "The Gospel According to Luke",
      "s": "I have found no cause of death in him: I will therefore chastise him, and let him go.",
      "src": {
        "work": "The Gospel According to Luke"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "christianisme.p0028",
      "w": "The Gospel According to Mark",
      "s": "And he stretched it out: and his hand was restored whole as the other.",
      "src": {
        "work": "The Gospel According to Mark"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "christianisme.p0029",
      "w": "The Gospel According to Mark",
      "s": "And he answered, saying, My name is Legion: for we are many.",
      "src": {
        "work": "The Gospel According to Mark"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "christianisme.p0030",
      "w": "The Gospel According to Mark",
      "s": "And they went out to see what it was that was done.",
      "src": {
        "work": "The Gospel According to Mark"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "christianisme.p0031",
      "w": "The Gospel According to Mark",
      "s": "Verily I say unto you, It shall be more tolerable for Sodom and Gomorrha in the day of judgment, than for that city.",
      "src": {
        "work": "The Gospel According to Mark"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "christianisme.p0032",
      "w": "The Gospel According to Mark",
      "s": "And she said, The head of John the Baptist.",
      "src": {
        "work": "The Gospel According to Mark"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "christianisme.p0033",
      "w": "The Gospel According to Mark",
      "s": "And many other things there be, which they have received to hold, as the washing of cups, and pots, brasen vessels, and of tables.",
      "src": {
        "work": "The Gospel According to Mark"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "christianisme.p0034",
      "w": "The Gospel According to Mark",
      "s": "And Peter answereth and saith unto him, Thou art the Christ.",
      "src": {
        "work": "The Gospel According to Mark"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "christianisme.p0035",
      "w": "The Gospel According to Mark",
      "s": "And they call the blind man, saying unto him, Be of good comfort, rise; he calleth thee.",
      "src": {
        "work": "The Gospel According to Mark"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "christianisme.p0036",
      "w": "The Gospel According to Mark",
      "s": "And immediately he received his sight, and followed Jesus in the way.",
      "src": {
        "work": "The Gospel According to Mark"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "christianisme.p0037",
      "w": "The Gospel According to Mark",
      "s": "And he saith unto them, Whose is this image and superscription?",
      "src": {
        "work": "The Gospel According to Mark"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "christianisme.p0038",
      "w": "The Gospel According to Mark",
      "s": "And no man after that durst ask him any question.",
      "src": {
        "work": "The Gospel According to Mark"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "christianisme.p0039",
      "w": "The Gospel According to Mark",
      "s": "And they all condemned him to be guilty of death.",
      "src": {
        "work": "The Gospel According to Mark"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "christianisme.p0040",
      "w": "The Gospel According to Mark",
      "s": "And a little after, they that stood by said again to Peter, Surely thou art one of them: for thou art a Galilaean, and thy speech agreeth thereto.",
      "src": {
        "work": "The Gospel According to Mark"
      }
    }
  ],
